{
  "_comment": "How examples/title-block-demo.dwg was built. Base: a copy of AutoCAD's acadiso.dwt (plain AutoCAD, millimetres, no Civil objects). Run: civil3dfactory.ps1 -Dwg <copy of acadiso.dwt as .dwg> -Task examples/build-title-block-demo.json  ({{C3DF_ROOT}} expands to the repository folder)",
  "ops": [
    {
      "op": "create_block_definition",
